    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Life is like a videotape, where colors and sounds are imprinted on the blank tape, old memories can be revisited again and again, and the dull part of the story can be fast-forwarded. But, someone always presses the STOP button.</i></strong></h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850850/extras/d236b84d7cbddb9ba377f6cb25b5a7b4.poster.avif?t=1709831604\" width=448 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850850/extras/d236b84d7cbddb9ba377f6cb25b5a7b4.webm?t=1709831604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850850/extras/d236b84d7cbddb9ba377f6cb25b5a7b4.mp4?t=1709831604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview:</h2><strong>Valley of Shadows</strong> is a short psychological horror game set in an ordinary American suburb. The story follows a regular family man named James, whose life takes an extraordinary turn when he returns home late at night after a hard day's work, only to find his house empty and his wife and daughter mysteriously vanished. A cryptic videotape left by an unknown visitor on the doorstep sets the stage for a chilling adventure.<br>As James attempts to unravel the mystery of his missing family, he is plagued by a sense of paranoia and the eerie feeling that he is constantly being watched. Paranormal forces turn his reality into a living nightmare, as he navigates through the unsettling environment, trying to piece together the clues left behind.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850850/extras/b019db0dd9cf633841a92d7d85bb743e.poster.avif?t=1709831604\" width=446 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850850/extras/b019db0dd9cf633841a92d7d85bb743e.webm?t=1709831604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850850/extras/b019db0dd9cf633841a92d7d85bb743e.mp4?t=1709831604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>    Built on Unreal Engine 5, creating an immersive and atmospheric environment with photorealistic graphics.<br></li><li>    Experience a &quot;walking simulator&quot; gameplay style, enriched with easy puzzles that enhance the storytelling.<br></li><li>    Valley of Shadows focuses on atmospheric psychological horror, prioritizing a lingering atmosphere of terror over cheap jumpscares.<br></li><li>    The game offers a concise narrative, with approximately 30 minutes of gameplay, perfect for a spine-tingling evening.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850850/extras/c40714ed5c9fdd009de23c93d1b2fefc.poster.avif?t=1709831604\" width=446 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850850/extras/c40714ed5c9fdd009de23c93d1b2fefc.webm?t=1709831604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850850/extras/c40714ed5c9fdd009de23c93d1b2fefc.mp4?t=1709831604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><i>Prepare to delve into the eerie unknown in Valley of Shadows, where every shadow hides a deeper darkness, and the line between the ordinary and the nightmare blurs.</i></strong>",
